window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Agent J Universe expands. Now, in book three, the interdimensional, time-warped, theological, labyrinthic mysteries of the Holy Sequence and its offspring, the Holy Darkness must be untangled by the ever resourceful, yet cold and calculating Agent J and his associate, the strikingly beautiful Russian operative, Natasha. And it must be done before an event occurs that will bring about the demise of mankind. Is there enough time...and is time what we think it is?</p>"; 
